Arcs_Tipus_capa_a_digitalitzar, "What kind of ARCS/LINES layer do you want to digitize?"
Arcs_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_1, "In the digitization of lines forming true arcs and nodes the use of topology allows a perfect control of the spatial relationships between the linear entities, avoiding artifacts "
Arcs_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_1_2, "like crossings that do not make explicit a connection node, or the existence of lines with coincident tracing. This is ideal for creating layers of lines that run through space in a never coincident way and with total control "
Arcs_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_1_3, "of their connections, such as in a river dataset; it is also adequate for detecting contacts between elements that do not have to occur, as in a layer of contour lines of different elevations."
 
Arcs_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_2, "Without topology a freer drawing is allowed, with crossing lines (the existence of nodes in the intersections is not always made explicit by cutting the lines) or even with total or partial overlaps. "
Arcs_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_3, "As an example of a layer where topological control is not appropriate, we can mention the generation of lines in a road layer when we are interested in the fact that the crossing of roads does not "
Arcs_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_4, "always generate a connection (as when the roads cross at different levels thanks to a bridge)."
 
 
Punts_Tipus_capa_a_digitalitzar,"What kind of POINTS layer do you want to digitize?"
Punts_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_1, "In the digitization of points the use of topology allows a perfect control of the spatial uniqueness between the point entities, avoiding artifacts "
Punts_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_1_2, "like the existence of different points in coincident locations. This is ideal for creating layers of points that require to be in space in a never coincident way, "
Punts_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_1_3, "such as in a dataset of rainfall stations."
 
Punts_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_2, "Without topology a freer drawing is allowed, with superposition of points in the same coordinate. As an example of a layer where topological control is not appropriate we can mention the generation of a simulation of lidar points in a forest area, "
Punts_Pregunto_si_vols_topologia_o_no_3, "where two signals can coexist in the same position at different heights, or with a different pulse code."

Control_topo_quedara_desactivat, "Topological control will be disabled."
Control_topo_no_es_pot_desactivar,	"Topological control cannot be disabled. \n\nIf you want, you can convert the layer to a format without topology, such as SHP, and re-import it into MiraMon indicating that you do NOT want topological structuring."
Com_refer_topo_PNT_1, "If you want to rebuild the point topology, use the VECPNT application, available in \"Edit | Build topology | Points\".\n\nIn the case of matching entities in space, "
Com_refer_topo_PNT_2, "only one will remain but multiple records will be created to preserve the different attributes in matching locations."
Com_refer_topo_ARC_1, "If you want to rebuild the arc/node topology, use the LinArc application, available in \"Edit | Build topology | Arcs/Nodes\".\n\nThe intersecting lines will be cut and, "
Com_refer_topo_ARC_2, "in the case of matching entities in space, only one will remain but multiple records will be created to preserve the different attributes in matching locations"
Com_refer_topo_POL_1, "If you want to rebuild the polygon topology you will need to chain several applications in the \"Edit | Build topology\" menu:\n\n1/ Use the Etiqueta application, available in "
Com_refer_topo_POL_2, "\"Automatic generation of polygon labels\" to convert the attributes of the polygons in labels.\n 2/ Use LinArc, available in \"Arcs/Nodes\" from the arcs of the polygons,"
Com_refer_topo_POL_3, "to get their edges.\n 3/ Rebuild again the polygons with Ciclar, available in \"Polygons\".\n 4/ Reassign the attributes of the polygons with the labels obtained in the first "
Com_refer_topo_POL_4, "step from AtriTop, available in \"Graphical objects labelling\".\n\nThis procedure will cut the intersecting edges of polygons and, in the case of coincident edges in space, only one will remain "
Com_refer_topo_POL_5, "but multiple records will be created to preserve the different attributes on each edge. The polygons will also be reconstructed, already with true topology and with the original attributes; in case of "
Com_refer_topo_POL_6, "areas coinciding in the space, only one will remain but multiple records will be created to preserve the different attributes in each zone."
Pregunta_unir_poligons_atts_dif,	"Ask when joining &polygons when attributes are different"
Pregunta_unir_arcs_atts_dif,		"Ask when joining a&rcs when attributes are different"
Simbolitzacio_restringida_a_pols_REL4, "Symbolization is restricted to REL4 metadata polygon files. Convert the layer to REL4 with MSA ConvREL (Tools | File maintenance | Conversion of MiraMon layers from format 1 to format 4) and you will be able to digitize."
Generar_backup_dir_capa_abans_digit, "Do you want to make a backup copy in the layer directory before you start digitizing?"
Generat_backup_a_s,					"Backup file %s has been generated"
No_generat_backup_a_s,				"Backup file %s has not been generated"
Blocatge_digit_1,					"This file is being digitized or edited in another session or by another user. Therefore, that digitizing or editing process must end before the file can be digitized or edited in any other session."
Blocatge_digit_2,					"Only if you are absolutely sure that the layer locking is incorrect (e.g., due to a power failure, a network error, an error in the session from which "
Blocatge_digit_3,					"it was digitized/edited, etc) and that there is not someone else, or yourself, digitizing/editing the layer, you can press the No button, which will release the lock."
Blocatge_digit_4,					"Do you want to stop the digitizing/editing process you just started?"
Blocatge_digit_5_s,					"The files you wanted to digitize or edit could not be unlocked. Contact your system administrator to obtain instructions on how to remove the file or files: %s"
Fitxer_s_altra_sessio_digitalitzant,"File \"%s\" (or any of the related) is in digitize/edit mode, so accessing it may destabilize this program session"
