Usa_Copia_especial_1,               "To obtain a perfect paste select, in the destination program, \"Special paste\" and \"Picture (ENHANCED Metafile)\" instead of a simple paste. "
Usa_Copia_especial_2,               "This procedure perfectly keeps the size and aspect ratio of your map.\r\n\r\nSpecial paste with Enhanced Metafile recognition is available in Word 97, PowerPoint 97, Corel 7, etc. "
Usa_Copia_especial_3,               "In previous versions (Office 95, etc) and in some cases, it could be better to generate an EMF and to insert it into the document (Insert | Image | From file).\r\n\r\nIn Word 2000 ALWAYS use \"Special paste\"."
